note = "\"UnifrakturMaguntia FontLog+AAoAPQA9AD0APQA9AD0APQA9AD0APQA9AD0APQA9AD0APQA9AD0APQA9AD0APQA9AD0APQA9AAoACgAA-UnifrakturMaguntia has been created by j. 'mach' wust. You can reach me at: j_mach_wust at shared-files dot de+AAoACgAA-UnifrakturMaguntia is a modification of Peter Wiegel's font Berthold Mainzer Fraktur that can be found at the following site (retrieved 2010-03-14) and that is in turn based on a 1901 typeface by Carl Albert Fahrenwaldt:+AAoACgAA-http://www.peter-wiegel.de/KochFraktur.html+AAoACgAA-UnifrakturMaguntia is basically identical to Wiegel's font, but the glyphs are given other codepoints so they are in accordance with the Unicode standard. Additionally, smart font rendering has been added in order to generate the font's ligatures.+AAoACgAK-Purpose+AAoAPQA9AD0APQA9AD0APQAKAAoA-UnifrakturMaguntia has been created in order to provide a Fraktur typeface that may be embedded on websites. It is in accordance with the Unicode standard. It has suitable font licenses (GPL with font exception and OFL). It comes with ready-made TTF, WOFF, SVG and EOT versions.+AAoACgAK-Files+AAoAPQA9AD0APQA9AAoACgAA* UnifrakturMaguntia.ttf+AAoA-A TrueType font version of UnifrakturMaguntia. This is the main font file you will want to install. It includes OpenType, Apple Advnaced Typography and SIL Graphite features.+AAoACgAA* UnifrakturMaguntia.eot+AAoA-An Embedded OpenType version of UnifrakturMaguntia. This is a special font file for the Windows Internet Explorer. It has been created by using the Font Squirrel's @font-face generator ( http://www.fontsquirrel.com/fontface/generator ).+AAoACgAA* UnifrakturMaguntia.woff+AAoA-A Web Open Font Format version of UnifrakturMaguntia. This is a the W3C's +ACIA-strong favourite+ACIA for standardization of embedded internet fonts. It is currently supported by Firefox. It has been created by using the Font Squirrel's @font-face generator ( http://www.fontsquirrel.com/fontface/generator ).+AAoACgAA* UnifrakturMaguntia.svg+AAoA-A SVG version of UnifrakturMaguntia. This is a special font file for the iPhone. It has been created by using the Font Squirrel's @font-face generator ( http://www.fontsquirrel.com/fontface/generator ).+AAoACgAA* Sources/UnifrakturMaguntia.sfd+AAoA-The FontForge source file of UnifrakturMaguntia. FontForge is a free font editor ( http://fontforge.sourceforge.net/ ). FontForge has been used to add OpenType features and to generate UnifrakturMaguntia.ttf+AAoACgAA* Sources/UnifrakturMaguntia.mif+AAoA-The Morph Input File of UnifrakturMaguntia. This file has been used to add Apple Advanced Typography features to UnifrakturMaguntia.ttf+AAoACgAA* Sources/UnifrakturMaguntia.gdl+AAoA-The Grapite description language file of UnifrakturMaguntia. This file has been used to add SIL Graphite features to UnifrakturMaguntia.ttf+AAoACgAA* OFL.txt+AAoA-The Open Font License.+AAoACgAA* FontLog.txt+AAoA-This FontLog file as required by the OFL.+AAoACgAA* OFL-FAQ.txt+AAoA-The Open Font License FAQ.+AAoACgAK-License+AAoAPQA9AD0APQA9AD0APQAKAAoA-This Font Software is licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. Note that this license is suited for embedding on webpages.+AAoACgAK-UnifrakturMaguntia change list+AAoAPQA9AD0APQA9AD0APQA9AD0APQA9AD0APQA9AD0APQA9AD0APQA9AD0APQA9AD0APQA9AD0APQA9AD0APQAKAAoA* 2010-11-24+AAoA    License change: UnifrakturMaguntia is now OFL only (with kind consent by Peter Wiegel); the name is now +ACIA-UnifrakturMaguntia+ACIA in order to prevent problems with a space in the font name. +AAoACgAA* 2010-08-17+AAoA    Ligatures may now be forced with ZWJ as recommended by Unicode.+AAoACgAA* 2010-07-21+AAoA    Added longs-t to required ligatures. Duplicated rlig ligatures in liga for pango compatibility.+AAoACgAA* 2010-06-19+AAoA    Moved ch, ck and tz required ligatures, so correct letterspacing is possible.+AAoACgAA* 2010-06-01+AAoA    Replaced README.txt by FontLog.txt, added new WOFF, SVG and EOT generated with Font Squirrel's @font-face generator.+AAoACgAA* 2010-05-25+AAoA    Added new glyps from Berthold Mainzer Fraktur UNZ1A.ttf; changed name from UnifrakturMaguntia to Unifraktur Maguntia.+AAoACgAA* 2010-03-24+AAoA    New version, based on a new version of Peter Wiegel's font that includes the additional ligatures longs_longs_i, longs_h, longs_j, longs_k, longs_s, s_k.+AAoACgAA* 2010-03-19+AAoA    Who whould have thought of that: AAT converts the sequence longs-longs-i into the ligature ffl. Ha ha, very funny... except it isn't.+AAoACgAA* 2010-03-18+AAoA    Added combining macron, so m_macron and n_macron no longer require AAT or Graphite. Fix for what appears to be a XeTeX bug with zero width characters.+AAoACgAA* 2010-03-17+AAoA    UnifrakturMaguntia has been created by j. 'mach' wust, as a modification of Peter Wiegel's font Bertholdr Mainzer Fraktur.+AAoA\"
";
properties = (
